ig enough  you know and he said  for the most part military hardware off  the table is that enough of a big stick  you know against the backdrops dude we  forget in just this year it's been it's  been a long year uh the first uh 11  months now the administration we forget  uh the fro was russia they shut down a  pipeline inside the united states  closing off gasoline to the united  states for days  and  president biden said don't do that again  i made what turned out to be a pretty  idle threat there were no real costs  imposed that we're aware of so i suspect  putin takes those threats with a grain  of salt it's going to take firm resolve  demonstrated resolve not just words but  deeds and a preparedness and a  demonstration of preparedness from the  by administration to stop putin from  acting in this coercive way  sure  um  i you know i remember you from when you  were our kansas congressman  what sort of traditions family cans and  traditions did you have at christmas  time mr secretary  you know we had a couple one of my  favorites was that every year our family  would gather together we would make the  secret pompeo  mercer fudge recipe it came from my  mom's side of the family was her mother  grace mercer's recipe  i released it when i was ca director we  thought it'd be fun to take a secret  recipe and release it when you were the  ci director  and we make it every year  my mom was mom was clearly in charge dad  and i and my brother and sister were the  labor but it was always joyous we would  make fudge we'd distribute it to people  in the neighborhood and teachers and the  like steve you know the kinds of things  families do together now my family my  wife susan my son nick and his fiancee  rachel will repeat that  now this year and it's a lot of fun just  to gather around in the kitchen to talk  and to to work a little bit and to do a  good turn for friends and people we love  well that's great obviously the fudge  recipe has been declassified because we 